# GitHub MCP Rules
- Default GitHub owner/username: `vivekkulthe-dev`
- Never guess or invent placeholder repository or organization names (such as `octocat` or `my-org`).
- When asked about "my repository" or "this repo", first inspect `.git/config` in the current workspace (or call `get_me` and `search_repositories`) to confirm the exact `owner` and `repo` name before calling GitHub MCP tools.
